C1  A DGND {CAPACITANCE+0.1pF}
.ends

*$
*-------------------------------------------------
* 74S Open Collector DtoA Subcircuit

.subckt DtoA_S_OC  D A  DPWR DGND
+	params: DRVL=0 DRVH=0 CAPACITANCE=0
*
N1  A DGND DPWR DIN74S_OC DGTLNET=D IO_S_OC
C1  A DGND {CAPACITANCE+0.1pF}
.ends

